      *                   PROGRAM COULD BE RECOMPILED FOR ORACLE 11G /
      *                   IBM 770 MIGRATION.
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 05/04/2001  BY: JOHN NERIO
      *           DESC: RACE RETROFIT.  CORRECTED SELECT AGAINST SUPER 
      *                 TABLE. (PGM WAS INCORRECTLY ADDING SUPERSEDED 
      *                 PARTS BACK IN THE PARTS TABLE DUE TO INCORRECT 
      *                 LOGIC.)
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 02/22/01  BY: GAIL WALDER 
      *           DESC: REINSERT ABEND LOGIC AND CODE FOR EMBEDDED SQL
      *                 Y1000-SQL-ERROR 
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 02/15/01  BY: MARINA BOGOPOLSKY
      *           DESC: ADDED Y1500-SQL-PROCEDURE-ERROR PARAGRAPH FOR
      *                 RACE II PROCEDURE CALLS
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 11/16/2000  BY: MARINA BOGOPOLSKY
      *          DESC:  RETROFITED ACCORDING TO CHANGES OF
      *                 DATABASE STRUCTURE
      *                 INITIALIZED NUMERIC WORKING STORAGE VARIABLES
      *                 TO ZERO
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 06/26/2000  BY: MARINA BOGOPOLSKY
      *           DESC: RACE II REVISIONS:
      *                 1. CONVERTED FOR NEW DATABASE STRUCTURE
      *                 2. CONVERTED EMBEDDED SQL TO PACKAGE/PROCEDURE CALLS
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 05/08/2000  BY: KIM DINH                                            
      *           DESC: ADD CURR_EFF_DT TO ALL QUEURIES THAT ACCESS 
      *                 IIST001 AND IIST002 TABLES       
      * ----------------------------------------------------------------
      * 07/09/99  BY:   JOHN CUSUMANO
      *           DESC: RACE- FIXED "NOT PROCESSED" COUNTER (RS-NOT-PROC-CTR)
      *                 FOR DISCONTINUED PARTS THAT ARE NOT IN THE PARTS FILE.
      *                 THESE DISC. PARTS WILL BE ADDED TO THE PARTS TABLE SO
      *                 TECHNICALLY THEY ARE NOT "NOT PROCESSED".
      * 03/12/99  BY:   JOHN CUSUMANO                                   
      *           DESC: RACE- ELIMINATE REFERENCE TO FLAT RATE          
